ft discharged by me.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.68,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-30-80"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4029051","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"88aa23f530633037fd3e6592afaed6bdff340e2eb3535df5ac40288af1bf0390","compact":"a502fa850d98388c793cc860bb720201652d42ccf34590c4aa00eafe1371bfa8","nasal":"5c10be2f40e0b47987629420e7659a9db81325aab099f0a4aaa236bb6b895f80"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-29-52","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":29,"verse":52,"english":"Beholding his elder brother thus enraged and bewailing, the fiery-spirited Laksmana, the best of men, became enraged with Sugrīva.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.869,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-30-81"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4029052","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"72c676c6d11a993edd2ae8571ea786c1666c6ae83aa973c2a7754c1b0c14dc3e","compact":"5802a1a520a240c4a2115cbb0ebbc3f12acf831e10f62103cbaf5a7cb102c4e1","nasal":"5802a1a520a240c4a2115cbb0ebbc3f12acf831e10f62103cbaf5a7cb102c4e1"}}]
